1
00:00:00,767 --> 00:00:02,700
The Dynasty Hotel
is mismanaged.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:05,067
And because of that,

3
00:00:05,067 --> 00:00:07,300
the management
is closing the hotel

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:08,533
at the end of the month.

5
00:00:08,533 --> 00:00:12,367
- [EMPLOYEES MURMURING]
- [GASPS]

6
00:00:12,367 --> 00:00:16,133
We will release your
separation pay immediately.

7
00:00:16,133 --> 00:00:21,167
We hope 30 days is enough
to find a new job again.

8
00:00:21,167 --> 00:00:23,633
Ma'am, that's not right!

9
00:00:23,633 --> 00:00:27,100
What are you doing here?
You're already fired!

10
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:29,167
To get my last salary.

11
00:00:29,167 --> 00:00:32,500
Well, you're fired again.

12
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,233
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

13
00:00:35,267 --> 00:00:37,333
[BRENDA ON VIDEO]
(Speaking in Korean) You bitch!

14
00:00:37,333 --> 00:00:41,767
- [HANNAH ON VIDEO]<i> Ma'am...
</i> - You bitch!

15
00:00:41,767 --> 00:00:45,233
- No wonder...
- [EMPLOYEES MURMURING]

16
00:00:45,233 --> 00:00:47,233
It's because of you again!

17
00:00:47,233 --> 00:00:49,600
[MRS. SONG] We took care
of the hotel's legacy.

18
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:53,333
And yet, Dynasty's
reputation is wrecked

19
00:00:53,333 --> 00:00:56,067
because of your cheap stunt!

20
00:00:56,067 --> 00:00:59,267
But, ma'am,
it's not their fault.

21
00:00:59,267 --> 00:01:00,367
[EMPLOYEES MURMURING]

22
00:01:00,367 --> 00:01:03,267
They give their all...

23
00:01:03,267 --> 00:01:06,033
everything to this hotel.

24
00:01:06,033 --> 00:01:08,200
Because of her harassment...

25
00:01:08,233 --> 00:01:10,600
abusing my kindness here,

26
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:13,067
you only have one week to pack,

27
00:01:13,067 --> 00:01:14,733
- Oh no!
- or else...

28
00:01:14,733 --> 00:01:17,433
I'll forcefully evict you all!

29
00:01:17,433 --> 00:01:19,233
- Ma'am, please...
- [EMPLOYEES MURMURING]

30
00:01:19,233 --> 00:01:21,533
Mrs. Song! Mrs. Song!

31
00:01:21,533 --> 00:01:22,567
Ma'am!

32
00:01:22,567 --> 00:01:24,100
Seriously, Hannah?

33
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:25,333
Stop it already!

34
00:01:25,333 --> 00:01:26,667
Don't play hero!

35
00:01:26,667 --> 00:01:28,433
You're just making
things worse!

36
00:01:28,433 --> 00:01:29,400
[BREATHING HEAVILY]

37
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:31,767
Mrs. Song! Mrs. Song!

38
00:01:31,767 --> 00:01:33,367
No, ma'am, please!

39
00:01:33,367 --> 00:01:35,133
- Manager.
- I need this job!

40
00:01:35,133 --> 00:01:37,100
[EMPLOYEES MURMURING
IN THE DISTANCE]

41
00:01:37,100 --> 00:01:39,200
[SIGHS DEEPLY]

42
00:01:41,833 --> 00:01:48,733
[GLUM MUSIC PLAYING]

43
00:01:51,233 --> 00:01:53,633
I've heard what happened.

44
00:01:53,633 --> 00:01:57,333
I promise to talk to Mrs. Song
and make things right.

45
00:02:00,433 --> 00:02:02,500
I want to talk to the chairman.

46
00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:06,733
[PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

47
00:02:06,733 --> 00:02:08,667
I want to talk to my father.

48
00:02:08,667 --> 00:02:15,533
[MUSIC BECOMES DRAMATIC]
